>> x := Obyekt yangi.
>> y := Obyekt yangi.
>> z := x.
Chiqish yozish: (x = z), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (x = y), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (x ≠ y), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (x ≠ z), yangi-qator.
>> m := Lahza yangi yil: 2070, oy: 11.
>> n := m nusxa.
Chiqish yozish: (m = n), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (m ≠ n), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (m aynan: m), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (m aynan: n), yangi-qator.
n oy: 12.
Chiqish yozish: (m ≠ n), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (m = n), yangi-qator.


